    <briefdescription>
<para>Static counter for non-commutative monomial comparisons. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bumped each time <computeroutput><ref refid="class_free_monoid_a6fc4850847d2662a28a9c0f9e2254686_1a6fc4850847d2662a28a9c0f9e2254686" kindref="member">FreeMonoid::compare</ref></computeroutput> is called; useful when profiling the inner loops of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_n_c_groebner" kindref="compound">NCGroebner</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="class_n_c_f4" kindref="compound">NCF4</ref></computeroutput>. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_free_monoid_logger_a564154aeb5464147157bb362c3e667f2_1a564154aeb5464147157bb362c3e667f2" kindref="member">reset()</ref></computeroutput> zeroes the counter and <computeroutput>operator&lt;&lt;</computeroutput> (declared below) pretty-prints the current value. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
